# HTTP vs HTTPS

| HTTP                                  | HTTPS                         |
| ------------------------------------- | ----------------------------- |
| HyperText Transfer Protocol           | HTTP Secure                   |
| Communication is not protected by TLS | Uses TLS encryption           |
| Uses `http://`                        | Uses `https://`               |
| Less suitable for sensitive data      | Used for secure communication |

